    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Rachel is the closest settlement to the Nellis Air Force Range and Area 51, giving it a modest celebrity status among aviation enthusiasts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rachel%2C_Nevada"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Despite its size, Rachel has never had a post office, a rarity for a town that still attracts visitors.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rachel%2C_Nevada"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Electricity reached Rachel on March 22, 1978, supplied by the Penoyer Valley Electric Cooperative, marking a major milestone in its development.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
